# Text files keep LF on every platform. The journal, proof packs and registries are hashed byte for
# byte; a checkout that turns LF into CRLF (git's default on Windows) would make an intact journal
# read as tampered and a generated file read as stale.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.ifc text eol=lf
